{"seq":1,"slug":"snowflake-bit-layout","title":"Snowflake 位布局与容量计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-id-clock-ordering/snowflake-family/snowflake-bit-layout","wordCount":1918,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"snowflake-位布局与容量计算\">Snowflake 位布局与容量计算</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Snowflake 的全部设计可以概括成一句话：在一个 64 位有符号整数里，用高位放时间、中位放机器、低位放同毫秒内序号。因为整数的数值序等于「时间优先、机器次之、序号最后」的字典序，ID 天然按时间排序，插入索引时落在右端。</p>\n<p>Twitter 2010 年公开的原始布局是：1 位符号位（恒为 0，保证生成的整数在 Java <code>long</code> 里为正）、41 位毫秒时间戳、10 位机器标识、12 位序列号（来源：Twitter snowflake 开源实现 <code>IdWorker.scala</code>，<code>twepoch = 1288834974657L</code>、<code>workerIdBits = 5</code>、<code>datacenterIdBits = 5</code>（合计 10 位机器位）、<code>sequenceBits = 12</code>、时间戳左移 22 位，<a href=\"https://github.com/twitter-archive/snowflake/blob/scala_28/src/main/scala/com/twitter/service/snowflake/IdWorker.scala）。\">https://github.com/twitter-archive/snowflake/blob/scala_28/src/main/scala/com/twitter/service/snowflake/IdWorker.scala）。</a></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;64 bit signed long&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;bit 63&lt;br/&gt;符号位 1 bit&lt;br/&gt;恒 0&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;bit 62..22&lt;br/&gt;时间戳 41 bit&lt;br/&gt;毫秒&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;bit 21..12&lt;br/&gt;机器 10 bit&lt;br/&gt;0..1023&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;bit 11..0&lt;br/&gt;序列 12 bit&lt;br/&gt;0..4095&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;可表示 2^41 ms&lt;br/&gt;≈ 69.7 年&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;最多 1024 个实例&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H[&quot;单机单毫秒&lt;br/&gt;最多 4096 个 ID&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"64 bit signed long\"] --&gt; B[\"bit 63&lt;br/&gt;符号位 1 bit&lt;br/&gt;恒 0\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"bit 62..22&lt;br/&gt;时间戳 41 bit&lt;br/&gt;毫秒\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"bit 21..12&lt;br/&gt;机器 10 bit&lt;br/&gt;0..1023\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"bit 11..0&lt;br/&gt;序列 12 bit&lt;br/&gt;0..4095\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"可表示 2^41 ms&lt;br/&gt;≈ 69.7 年\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"最多 1024 个实例\"]\n    E --&gt; H[\"单机单毫秒&lt;br/&gt;最多 4096 个 ID\"]</pre><p>三段各自的位数决定了三件事的容量：ID 方案能用多少年、最多部署多少个生成实例、单个实例每秒的吞吐上限。这三者之和固定为 63 位，所以任何一段加宽都必须从别处让出位数——这就是容量计算的全部内容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间位-epoch-与寿命\">时间位：epoch 与寿命</h2><p>时间位存的不是 Unix 时间戳本身，而是「当前毫秒与自定义 epoch 之差」。选择 epoch 的唯一目的是把有限的 41 位用在业务真正需要的年份区间上。</p>\n<p>41 位能表示的毫秒数是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>41</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mn>199</mn><mtext> </mtext><mn>023</mn><mtext> </mtext><mn>255</mn><mtext> </mtext><mn>552</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{41} = 2\\,199\\,023\\,255\\,552</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">41</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">199</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">023</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">255</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">552</span></span></span></span></span>。换算成年：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>41</mn></msup><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>365.25</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2.199</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3.156</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>69.7</mn><mtext> 年</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{years} = \\frac{2^{41}}{1000 \\times 60 \\times 60 \\times 24 \\times 365.25} \\approx \\frac{2.199 \\times 10^{12}}{3.156 \\times 10^{10}} \\approx 69.7 \\text{ 年}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2604em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">365.25</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">41</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2604em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3.156</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2.199</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">69.7</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若直接用 Unix epoch（1970-01-01），69.7 年后是 2039 年，这在 2026 年已经不算遥远。所以生产实现几乎都会推后 epoch：取一个接近项目启动的时间点作为零点，就能把可用窗口整体平移。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>epoch 选择</th>\n<th>零点</th>\n<th>时间位耗尽时刻</th>\n<th>相对当前余量（2026）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Unix epoch</td>\n<td>1970-01-01</td>\n<td>2039-09-07</td>\n<td>约 13 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2010-11-04（Twitter 原始）</td>\n<td>2010-11-04</td>\n<td>2080-08-02</td>\n<td>约 54 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2020-01-01</td>\n<td>2020-01-01</td>\n<td>2089-09-04</td>\n<td>约 63 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2024-01-01</td>\n<td>2024-01-01</td>\n<td>2093-09-05</td>\n<td>约 67 年</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个必须注意的细节。</p>\n<p>第一，epoch 必须写进所有相关系统的配置且永不修改。把 epoch 往前推会让「零点的定义」改变，已经发出的 ID 反解出来的时间全部偏移；把 epoch 往后推更危险，因为新 ID 的数值可能小于历史 ID，破坏趋势递增。epoch 是协议的组成部分，应当和位布局一起写进接口文档并纳入变更评审。</p>\n<p>第二，寿命计算必须用毫秒而不是秒。一个常见错误是「41 位秒级时间可以用 69000 年」——这需要 41 位存秒数才成立，但秒级精度意味着同一秒内所有 ID 都要靠序列位区分，单机每秒上限骤降到 4096，多数写入型业务不够用。除非你的场景明确是低吞吐且要超长寿命（如资产编号、合同号），否则毫秒是默认选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"机器位-1024-个实例够不够\">机器位：1024 个实例够不够</h2><p>10 位机器位给出 1024 个不重复的实例编号。这个数字在 Twitter 时代足够，在 Kubernetes 时代常常不够——不是因为同时运行的实例超过 1024，而是因为「实例身份」不再稳定：Pod 重建后 IP 变了，扩容时临时副本需要临时编号。</p>\n<p>评估机器位是否足够，要看的是「历史上使用过该编号的实例是否还在同时写入」。同一个编号只要在时间上被两个实例重叠使用，就会产生重复 ID。因此真正约束不是 1024 这个上限，而是编号的回收策略——这一点在 <a href=\"worker-id-allocation\">workerId 分配、冲突与中心化注册</a> 里详细展开。</p>\n<p>如果确实需要更多实例，有两条路：一是从时间位或序列位借位（例如改成 40 位时间 + 12 位机器 + 11 位序列），代价是寿命减半或单毫秒吞吐减半；二是让每个实例在一毫秒内可以「借用」多个编号，这需要额外的协调，本质是把分配问题推给了运行时。</p>\n<p>一个实用的经验值：机器位取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 时最多 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个实例，若你目标的最大并发写入实例数是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，留 2 倍余量即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = \\lceil \\log_2(2n) \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)⌉</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"序列位-同毫秒内的吞吐上限\">序列位：同毫秒内的吞吐上限</h2><p>序列位决定单个实例在同一毫秒内能生成多少个 ID。12 位即 4096 个。</p>\n<p>单实例理论 QPS 上限为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext> </mtext><mn>096</mn><mtext> </mtext><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">QPS_{max} = 2^{12} \\times 1000 = 4\\,096\\,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">QP</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">096</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>看似充裕，但真实瓶颈不在序列位，而在两处。第一处是「同毫秒内序列耗尽后的等待」：如果某个实例在一毫秒内生成了超过 4096 个 ID，实现必须等到下一毫秒再继续，这在突发流量下会变成实际延迟尖刺。第二处是时钟精度：若系统时钟的推进粒度粗于 1 毫秒（部分虚拟化环境与旧内核如此），<code>currentTimeMillis</code> 可能在几毫秒内返回同一个值，序列位会更快耗尽。</p>\n<p>序列位的另一个容易被忽略的规则是重置时机。正确行为是「每次毫秒值变化时把序列归零」，而不是「每次生成后递增到溢出再归零」。如果实现忘记在毫秒变化时归零，序列会从上次的值继续累加，最终溢出到机器位，产生错误的 ID。这是一个在自研实现中反复出现的 bug，单测里表现为「同一毫秒内生成的第一个 ID 与上一毫秒的最后一个 ID 之差不是 1 或大跳变」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>布局变体</th>\n<th>时间位</th>\n<th>机器位</th>\n<th>序列位</th>\n<th>寿命</th>\n<th>实例数</th>\n<th>单机单毫秒</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Twitter 原始</td>\n<td>41</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>69.7 年</td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>4096</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机器优先（多为 K8s）</td>\n<td>41</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>69.7 年</td>\n<td>4096</td>\n<td>2048</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长寿命（资产编码）</td>\n<td>43</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>278 年</td>\n<td>256</td>\n<td>4096</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高吞吐（日志）</td>\n<td>39</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>17.4 年</td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>16384</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>秒级（低吞吐）</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>21</td>\n<td>136 年</td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>2 097 152</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表说明布局是可以按业务调形的，但每一次调形都要重新验算寿命、实例数与吞吐三条不等式是否同时满足目标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用代码验证布局与反解\">用代码验证布局与反解</h2><p>位布局的设计错误几乎都出现在反解环节——生成时看着对，反解时时间差了 8 小时或算出机器号越界。下面给出一个最小实现，同时包含生成与反解，便于对照检查：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const EPOCH = 1735689600000n; // 2025-01-01T00:00:00Z，毫秒&#10;const MACHINE_BITS = 10n;&#10;const SEQ_BITS = 12n;&#10;const MAX_MACHINE = (1n &lt;&lt; MACHINE_BITS) - 1n;&#10;const MAX_SEQ = (1n &lt;&lt; SEQ_BITS) - 1n;&#10;&#10;export function compose(nowMs: number, machineId: number, seq: number): bigint {&#10;  const m = BigInt(machineId);&#10;  if (m &gt; MAX_MACHINE) throw new Error(&#39;machineId out of range&#39;);&#10;  if (BigInt(seq) &gt; MAX_SEQ) throw new Error(&#39;seq exhausted in this ms&#39;);&#10;  const ts = BigInt(nowMs) - EPOCH;&#10;  if (ts &lt; 0n) throw new Error(&#39;clock before epoch&#39;);&#10;  return (ts &lt;&lt; (MACHINE_BITS + SEQ_BITS)) | (m &lt;&lt; SEQ_BITS) | BigInt(seq);&#10;}&#10;&#10;export function decompose(id: bigint) {&#10;  const seq = id &amp; MAX_SEQ;&#10;  const machineId = (id &gt;&gt; SEQ_BITS) &amp; MAX_MACHINE;&#10;  const ts = (id &gt;&gt; (MACHINE_BITS + SEQ_BITS)) + EPOCH;&#10;  return { ts: Number(ts), machineId: Number(machineId), seq: Number(seq) };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> EPOCH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1735689600000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2025-01-01T00:00:00Z，毫秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MACHINE_BITS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SEQ_BITS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 12</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX_MACHINE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MACHINE_BITS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79